#============================================================
# GPIO headers JP1 (GPIO 0) and JP2 (GPIO 1), and the HDMI/fan I2C bus
# Pin numbers from Terasic's golden top (DE25-Nano resource package, revision B) and the
# DE25-Nano user manual, tables 3-7 and 3-12:
# GPIOn_D[0..9] = header pins 1-10, [10..25] = 13-28, [26..35] = 31-40.
#============================================================
